{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2959","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2959","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2959\",\"parent_revision\":\"70fbccb4cbc133bf22051c2ba59ef8dd194817a5de66b4fca314c5100c4b2a01\",\"root_revision\":\"70fbccb4cbc133bf22051c2ba59ef8dd194817a5de66b4fca314c5100c4b2a01\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-18\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n`skills/work-backlog-item/references/workflows/groom/finalize.md`'s RT-ICA Final Pass Step 1 instructs the orchestrator to \\\"Extract: Impact Radius, Fact-Check, Issue Classification, Research (if Wave 0 ran), groomed subsections\\\" before re-assessing conditions and deciding APPROVED/BLOCKED. Design Intent Alignment \u2014 the section `swarm.md`'s `alignment-analyst` teammate produces, with a verdict of ALIGNED/DIVERGENT/NOT_APPLICABLE \u2014 is never named in that extraction list, and nothing else in `finalize.md`'s RT-ICA re-assessment procedure references it either.\\n\\nThis surfaced concretely on #2953: `alignment-analyst` returned a DIVERGENT verdict (the item's premise was found to be in direct tension with a prior, empirically-verified design decision in PR #2939), broadcast it, and wrote it to the item's Design Intent Alignment section \u2014 but nothing in `finalize.md`'s documented RT-ICA Final Pass procedure would ever read or factor that section into the final APPROVED/BLOCKED decision. A structurally significant mission-alignment concern has no wired mechanism connecting it to the gate that decides whether grooming proceeds to a completed, planning-ready state.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session observation \u2014 discovered during retrospective sweep of groom-workflow docs while grooming #2953, 2026-08-18\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-18\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **finalize.md's rt-ica final pass extraction list omits design intent alignment, so divergent mission-alignment findings have no path into the approved/blocked decision** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"7b739a3e94efaf137ff9591b4cc0b26cab1412bf72b8000900bff41d30ed1f0e\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPTbi5A\"}"}